ns the most marker pixels.  Input structure - The upper-left cell is background. - The foreground consists of multiple 4-connected solid rectangles made from   a common fill color, with a rarer marker color replacing some cells.  Rule - Treat the rarer of the two foreground colors as the marker color. - Count marker pixels inside each foreground rectangle. - Return the exact bounding-box crop of the unique rectangle with the largest   marker count.  Key insight - The output is not redrawn or recolored; it is one existing input rectangle   selected by the count of its marker pixels. </description> <annotation> {   "type": "transform_in_place",   "src": "solid foreground rectangles containing sparse marker pixels",   "transform": "select the rectangle with the largest marker-pixel count and return it unchanged",   "grid_shape": "tight crop to the selected rectangle bbox" } </annotation> </reference_puzzle>  ## 必读参考代码路径  执行前请至少快速阅读这些文件的 `main()` 和 `generate_input()`，重点看它们如何避免退化输入、如何随机放置对象、如何验证隐式假设：  - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/2601afb7.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/eval/62593bfd.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/afe3afe9.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/eval/0bb8deee.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/b548a754.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/b2862040.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/3ad05f52.py` - `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC1_code/train/8efcae92.py`  ## 公共参考工具箱  执行前还必须快速阅读 `/home/lixinyu/snap/new/solvers/arc_utils.py`。它是 ARC 公共工具箱，包含统一的 `(r, c)` 坐标约定、bbox、连通域、裁剪、几何变换、颜色和网格操作等公共实现。生成代码时优先参考或复用这些函数；若直接 import，请确保目标文件仍可被 `SourceFileLoader` 直接加载，自检命令能独立运行。  ## 实现要求  1. `main(grid)` 必须实现新题描述中的确定性转换规则，不能只识别 `generate_input()` 的固定模板。禁止不同的input网格输出相同的output网格。 2. `generate_input()` 必须随机生成多样样例，不能固定死。随机维度应覆盖：网格大小、对象数量、位置、颜色、方向、形状参数或关键分支。注意若描述中存在若干，需实现而不是只有单个，包括object或者对应关系等等。 3. 生成器必须保证输入满足 `main()` 的隐式假设：对象不重叠、不越界、特殊标记唯一或可区分、匹配关系无歧义、关键分支出现概率相同。 4. 禁止把 ARC 颜色 id 、亮度、拼写等当作人类不可见的数值语义参与排序、大小比较或隐藏映射。颜色变化必须有