在每个局部坐标处，自上层向下层查找，输出第一个非黑的颜色；   四处全黑则输出黑。 - 输出尺寸等于单条带。  关键洞察 - 图层次序既不是带的排列顺序也不是固定表，而是每条带自身的拓扑   性质；必须先对每层整体做封闭空洞计数，才知道谁压住谁——按   位置顺序叠加在部分示例上会碰巧成立，在其余示例上必然失败。 ``` </new_puzzle>  ## 机制相似参考题  下面参考题由本地相似度流程自动选择：若新题写明了标签、主要机制、来源原语或显式参考题 id，则优先作为检索信号；若没有这些信息，就只从题面 docstring、输入结构、规则和关键洞察中抽取机制信号。文件头的参考题组只作为弱提示，不代表本题规则来源。参考题只能用于学习对象识别方式、随机生成器约束和边界条件处理，禁止照搬旧题规则。  已选参考：train/3ad05f52, eval/62593bfd, eval/0bb8deee, train/afe3afe9, train/b548a754, train/b2862040, train/2601afb7, eval/3d31c5b3  新题正文显式提及的参考题 id：1732050808  文件头参考题组 id（弱提示）：08573cc6, 0bb8deee, 2601afb7, 3ad05f52, 3d31c5b3, 62593bfd, 6f8cd79b, 7666fa5d, 8efcae92, 95755ff2, afe3afe9, b2862040, b2bc3ffd, b548a754, ba97ae07, bbb1b8b6, cf5fd0ad, d4c90558, d94c3b52, ed74f2f2  <reference_puzzle rank="1" source="train" puzzle_id="3ad05f52"> <similarity> score=0.2600 mechanism=0.0000 lexical=0.0000 code_feature=0.6667 overlap_tags=none </similarity> <paths> code=/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/3ad05f52.py annotation=/home/lixinyu/snap/new/annotations/3ad05f52.json </paths> <description> Paint the maze corridor and framed rooms lying on shortest paths between the two colored endpoint components.  Input structure - The grid has a dominant background, one wall color forming thin orthogonal frames, and one endpoint/fill color. - The endpoint/fill color forms exactly two 4-connected solid rectangular components; their larger side lengths define the framed room sizes.  Rule - Treat wall pixels as blocked and every other pixel as passable. - Find every passable pixel that lies on a shortest 4-connected path between the two endpoint components. - Also fill any framed square room of an endpoint-derived size that intersects that shortest-path mask.  Key insight - Shortest paths identify the route through open connector corridors, while the wall-bordered square rooms need to be expanded from the route centerline to their full interior. </description> <annotation> {   "type": "move_along_path",   "src": "one of two same-color endp